sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Scheduler.schedule
  participant RQ as running
  participant K as KVCacheManager
  participant WQ as waiting
  S->>S: token_budget = max_num_scheduled_tokens
  loop 遍历 running（按顺序）
    S->>S: num_new = num_tokens_with_spec − num_computed_tokens
    S->>S: num_new = min(num_new, long_prefill阈值, token_budget)
    S->>K: allocate_slots(req, num_new, num_lookahead)
    alt 返回 None（块不够）
      S->>RQ: 弹出最低优先级请求（FCFS 为队尾）
      S->>K: free(被抢占者)；状态→PREEMPTED，num_computed_tokens=0
      S->>WQ: 放回 waiting 队首
    else 成功
      S->>S: token_budget −= num_new
    end
  end
  alt 本步未发生抢占
    loop 遍历 waiting（直到预算或 max_num_seqs 用完）
      S->>K: get_computed_blocks(req) 前缀命中
      S->>S: num_new = num_tokens − 命中 token 数（chunked 截断）
      S->>K: allocate_slots(req, num_new, 命中块)
      S->>RQ: 移入 running
    end
  end
  S-->>S: 组装 SchedulerOutput
